This project is a C++ port and extension of barnes-hut by DeadlockCode:
https://github.com/DeadlockCode/barnes-hut

The quadtree layout (flat nodes, `next` skip pointers, in-place partitioned
build), the force law, the uniform-disc initial conditions and the collision
response are ported from that Rust implementation. barnes-hut is licensed
under either of the Apache License, Version 2.0 or the MIT License; its MIT
license text is reproduced below.

